~ start

The Pork:  Welcome traveller! No time to talk, [wave amp=25 freq=5]giant bugs[/wave] are attacking our beautiful town!
The Pork: The guard is too lazy to help. [shake rate=20 level=10]Please help us![/shake]

- What can I do to help? 
	The Pork: Go into the first area and mess up as many bugs as you can.
	The Pork: Use W A S D to control the character and your mouse to control the gun. Use the left mouse button to shoot! Don't forget to press "M" on your keyboard to switch your default weapon.
	The Pork: The bugs will drop [wave amp=25 freq=5]coins[/wave] and sometimes [wave amp=25 freq=5]pork[/wave]. The pork will heal you! 
	The Pork: Once you accumulate[wave amp=25 freq=5] 20[/wave] coins, proceed to the next area.
	The Pork: Once you get[wave amp=25 freq=5] 200 [/wave]coins, you saved the town!
	The pork: Don't be afraid to faint, you'll be carried back here. 
- Could you explain how the levels work? 
	The Pork: Glady!
	The Pork: To start, go to [wave amp=25 freq=5]level one[/wave].
	The Pork: Level one has a coin cap of [shake rate=20 level=10]40 coins[/shake]. Once you reach that, you'll be deemed too strong for that area and you'll be [shake rate=20 level=10]kicked out[/shake].
	The Pork: You won't be able to re-enter level one if you have [shake rate=20 level=10]more than 20 coins[/shake]. 
	The Pork: However, that means you'll be able to start level two! But watch out, the enemies are much faster and it costs [shake rate=20 level=10]20 coins[/shake] every time you want to re-enter the level.
	The Pork: But don't worry, if you ever run out, you'll be able to re-attempt level one as long as you have less than 20 coins!
- Goodbye!
	The Pork: [shake rate=20 level=10]Please save the town![/shake]

=> END!
